// ---------- 🐉⭐ GEAR SET BONUSES (ใส่อุปกรณ์ครบเซ็ตมังกร/ตำนาน) — counts EQUIPPED pieces sharing a `set` tag ----------
// Cumulative tiers: every reached threshold adds its bonus. 7 slots max (weapon+outfit+hat+mask+gloves+pants+shoes).
